hadiths[117]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1205","Anas (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya hai ki Nabi (ﷺ) ne kabir gunahon ke baare mein farmaya: \Allah ko shirk karna...\"""""""
"1206","Hannad ne hamari taraf riwayat ki: ‘Abdah ibn Sulayman ne hamari taraf riwayat ki, ‘Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman se, Sa‘eed ibn Jubayr se, unhone farmaya: Mujh se Mus‘ab ibn al-Zubayr ki wilayat ke dauran un donon ke baare mein poochha gaya jo li‘an (aapas mein la‘nat ki qurbani) karte hain — kya unhein alag kiya jaye — aur mujhe kuch nahi pata tha ke kya kahoon. Main ‘Abdullah ibn ‘Umar (radiyAllahu ‘anhu) ke ghar gaya aur dakhil hone ki ijazat maangi. Mujhe bataya gaya ke woh araam kar rahe hain. Unhon ne mera suna aur pukara: “Ibn Jubayr, andar aao! Toh aaj tak kisi zaroorat ke liye hi aaya hai.” Main gaya aur unhein ek saddlecloth par lete hue paya. Maine kaha: “Ya Abu ‘Abd al-Rahman, li‘an karne walon ke baare mein — kya unhein alag kiya jaye?” Unhon ne kaha: “SubhanAllah! Haan! Pehle is sawaal ka jawab dene wala woh tha jo RasoolAllah ﷺ ke paas aaya aur kaha: ‘Ya RasoolAllah, agar hum mein se koi apni biwi ko fahash dekhe toh kya kare? Agar woh bole toh bohot buri baat bole, aur agar chup rahe toh bohot buri baat chup rahe.’ RasoolAllah ﷺ ne chup raha aur jawab nahi diya. Baad mein woh shakhs phir aaya aur kaha: ‘Ya RasoolAllah, mujh par woh museebat aa gayi jiske baare mein maine aap se poochha tha.’ Phir Allah Ta‘ala ne Surah al-Nur ki aayat nazil ki: ‘Aur jo apni biwiyon par ilzaam lagayein aur unke gawah khud hi hon…’ (aayat ke aakhir tak). Phir RasoolAllah ﷺ ne us shakhs ko bulaya, us par aayat tilawat ki, usay nasihat ki, usay yaad dilaya aur bataya ke duniya ki saza aakhirat ki saza se halki hai. Us shakhs ne qasam khaayi: ‘Us zaat ki qasam jisne aapko haq ke saath bheja, maine uske baare mein jhoot nahi bola.’ Phir RasoolAllah ﷺ ne aurat ki taraf mutawajjha hokar usay nasihat ki, usay yaad dilaya aur bataya ke duniya ki saza aakhirat ki saza se halki hai. Us ne qasam khaayi: ‘Us zaat ki qasam jisne aapko haq ke saath bheja, woh sachcha nahi hai.’ Phir RasoolAllah ﷺ ne mard se shuru‘ kiya, us ne chaar baar Allah ki qasam khaayi ke woh sachche mein se hain, aur paanchvi baar apne par Allah ki la‘nat ki qasam khaayi agar woh jhooton mein se ho. Phir aurat ki taraf mutawajjha hui, us ne chaar baar Allah ki qasam khaayi ke woh jhooton mein se hain, aur paanchvi baar apne par Allah ki ghadab ki qasam khaayi agar woh sachche mein se ho. Phir RasoolAllah ﷺ ne unhein alag kar diya.” \n\n(Al-Tirmidhi ne farmaya:) Is mauzoo‘ par Sahl ibn Sa‘d, Ibn ‘Abbas, Ibn Mas‘ud aur Hudhayfah (radiyAllahu ‘anhum) ki bhi riwayatein hain. Ibn ‘Umar ki hadith hasan sahih hai, aur ‘ulama ki amal isi par hai."
"1207","Qutaybah ne hamain bataya: Malik ibn Anas ne Nafi‘ se riwayat ki, aur Nafi‘ ne Ibn ‘Umar (radiyAllahu ‘anhum) se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya: Ek mard ne apni biwi ke khilaf li‘an (la‘nat ka hukm) kiya, to Nabi ﷺ ne un donon ko juda kar diya aur bachchi ko maa ke saath thehraaya. Abu ‘Isa ne farmaya: Ye ek hasan sahih hadith hai, aur ‘ulama ka amal isi par hai."
"1208","Al-Ansari ne hamain ittela’a di: Ma‘n ne hamain ittela’a di: Malik ne hamain ittela’a di, Sa‘d ibn Ishaq ibn Ka‘b ibn ‘Ujrah se, unki ammi Zaynab bint Ka‘b ibn ‘Ujrah se, unhone bataya ke al-Furay‘ah bint Malik ibn Sinan — jo Abu Sa‘id al-Khudri ki behan thin — ne unhein ittela’a di ke unhone Rasool Allah ﷺ ke paas aakar apne ghar wapas jaane ki ijazat maangi, kyunki unke shohar kuch bhagaye hue ghulaam kee talaash mein nikle the. Jab woh al-Qudum ke kinaare pahunche, to un logon ne unhein pakad liya aur qatal kar diya. Unhone kaha: “Maine Rasool Allah ﷺ se apne ghar wapas jaane ki ijazat maangi, kyunki mera shohar mujhe koi apna ghar nahi chhoda tha aur na hi koi nafaqa.” Unhone kaha: “Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: ‘Haan.’” Unhone kaha: “Main chali, lekin jab main kamre ya masjid mein thi, to Rasool Allah ﷺ ne mujhe pukara ya hukm diya ke mujhe bulaya jaye. Main bulayi gayi, aur Unhon ne farmaya: ‘Tumne kya kaha?’” Unhone kaha: “Maine Unhein apne shohar ke baare mein wahi kahani dobara suna jo maine pehle sunayi thi.” Unhon ne farmaya: ‘Apne ghar mein raho takbeed tak kee muddat poori ho jaye.’” Unhone kaha: “Mainne wahan chaar maheene aur das din ka ‘iddat ada kiya.” Unhone kaha: “Jab ‘Uman (radi Allahu anhu) khilafat ke zimma aaye, to unhone mujhe bulaaya aur is maamle ke baare mein poocha. Maine Unhein ittela’a di, aur unhone is hukm par amal kiya aur is mutabiq faisla diya.”\n\nMuhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamain ittela’a di: Yahya ibn Sa‘id ne hamain ittela’a di: Sa‘d ibn Ishaq ibn Ka‘b ibn ‘Ujrah ne hamain ittela’a di, isi tarah kee riwayat se jis mein wahi ma‘ni maujood hai. Abu ‘Isa ne kaha: Yeh hasan sahih hadith hai. Yeh amal hai jis par zyaadatar ulama — Nabi ﷺ ke Sahaba aur dusron mein se — ka ittefaaq hai: woh ‘iddat ada karne wali aurat ko uske shohar ke ghar se bahar jaane ki ijazat nahi dete takbeed tak kee muddat poori ho jaye. Yeh Sufyan al-Thawri, al-Shafi‘i, Ahmad, aur Ishaq ka qaul hai.\n\nKuch ulama — Nabi ﷺ ke Sahaba aur dusron mein se — ka qaul hai ke aurat ‘iddat jahan chahein ada kar sakte hain, chahe woh uske shohar ke ghar mein na ho. Abu ‘Isa ne kaha: Pehla qaul zyada sahih hai."
"1209","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamen ikhtiyar diya ( chahen to hum aap key nikah mein rahen aur chahen to na rahen ( hamney aap ko ikhtiyar kya. kya ye Talaq maana gaee thi ? padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- ( sath rehney aur na rehney key ( ikhtiyar deney mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai. 3- umr aur Abdullah bin Masood Raziallahu anhuma ka kehna hai ke agar aurat ney khud ko ikhtiyar kar liya to talaq-baaina hogi . aur unhi dono ka ye qol bhi hai ke eik Talaq hogi aur usey wapasi ka ikhtiyar hoga . aur agar usney apney shohar hi ko ikhtiyar kya to is par kuch na hoga yani koi Talaq waqey na hogi, 4- aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke agar usney khud ko ikhtiyar kya to talaqe-baain hogi aur agar usney apney shohar ko ikhtiyar kya to eik hogi lekin wapasi ka ikhtiyar hoga, 5- Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke agar usney apney shohar ko ikhtiyar kya to eik hogi aur agar khud ko ikhtiyar kya to teen hongi , 6- Sahaba kiram aur unkey baad key logon mein sey aksar ehle-ilm o fiq'h is baab mein umr aur Abdullah bin Masood Raziallahu anhuma key qol ki taraf gaey hain aur yehi Sory aur ehle-koofa ka bhi qol hai, 7- albatta Ahmed bin Hanbal ka qol wohi hai jo Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ka hai."
"1210","Fatima bint Qais (Raziallahu Anha) kehti hain ke mujhey merey shohar ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney mein teen talaaqein din padhi. to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' tumhen na ( rihaaish ( milega aur na « nafqa » ( اخراجات ( ''. Mughira kehtey hain : phir mainey uska zikr Ibrahim Nakhai sey kya, to unhoney kaha ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka kehna hai ke hum eik aurat key kehney sey Allah ki kitab aur Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki sunnat ko tarak nahin kar saktey . hamen nahin malum ke usey ye baat yad bhi hai ya bhool gaee . umr aisi aurat ko «rihaaish» aur « nafqa » dilaatey they. dusri sanad sey Hushem kehtey hain ke hum sey Dawud ney bayan kya Shaaby kehtey hain : main Fatima bint Qais (Raziallahu Anha) key paas aaya aur mainey un sey unkey barey mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key faisley key mutalliq puchha to unhoney kaha : unkey shohar ney unhen Talaq bitta di to unhoney « rihaaish» aur « nafqa » key silsiley mein muqadma kya. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen na rihaaish hi dlwaya aur na « nafqa » . Dawud ki hadees mein ye bhi hai ke unhoney kaha : aur mujhey aap ney hukm diya ke main ibn Umme maktoom key ghar mein iddat guzaaron . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- baaz ehle-ilm ka yehi qol hai. un mein Hasan Basri , Ata bin abi Ribah aur Shaaby bhi hain. aur yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi kehtey hain. un logon ka kehna hai ke mutallaqa key liye jab uska shohar wapasi ka ikhtiyar na rakhey na rihaaish hogi aur na nafqa , padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram mein sey baaz ehle-ilm jin mein umr aur Abdullah bin Masood Raziallahu anhuma hain kehtey hain ke teen Talaq wali aurat ko «rihaaish» aur « nafqa » dono milega . yehi Sory aur ehle-koofa ka bhi qol hai, 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : usey « rihaaish» milega « nafqa » nahin milega . ye Malik bin Anas , Les bin Saad aur Shafai ka qol hai, 5- Shafai kehtey hain ke hamney uskey liye «rihaaish» ka haq kitabullah ki buniyad par rakha hai, Allah Taala farmata hai : unhen unkey gharon sey na nikalo aur wo bhi na niklen siwaye uskey ke wo khullam khulla koi be-hayai kar bethein padhi. , «"
"1211","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' ibne-Adam key liye aisi chiz mein nazar nahin jis ka wo ikhtiyar na rakhta ho, aur na usey aisey shakhs ko azad karney ka ikhtiyar hai jis ka wo Malik na ho, aur na usey aisi aurat ko Talaq deney ka haq hasil hai jiska wo Malik na ho ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Ali , Muaz bin jabal, Jabir, ibne-Abbas aur Aaisha (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain. aur ye sab sey behtar hadees hai jo is baab mein riwayat ki gaee hai, 3- yehi Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey aksar ehle-ilm ka qol hai. aur Ali bin abi Talib , ibne-Abbas , Jabir bin Abdullah , Saeed bin Museiyab, Hasan , Saeed bin Juber , Ali bin Husein, Shureh , Jabir bin Zaid (Raziallauh anhum) , aur fuqaha Tabe-een mein sey bhi kaee logon sey yehi marvi hai. aur yehi Shafai ka bhi qol hai, 4- aur ibne-Masood sey marvi hai unhoney mansubey key silsiley mein kaha hai ke Talaq ho jaeygi, 5- aur ehle-ilm mein sey Ibrahim Nakhai aur Shaaby waghera sey marvi hai un logon ka kehna hai ke jab wo kisi waqt ki tehdeed karey padhi. to Talaq waqey ho jaeygi . aur yehi Sufiyan Sory aur Malik bin Anas ka bhi qol hai ke jab usney kisi mutayyan aurat ka naam liya , ya kisi waqt ki tahdeed ki ya yun kaha : agar mainey falan mahalley ki aurat sey shaadi ki to usey Talaq hai. to agar usney shaadi kar li to usey Talaq waqey ho jaeygi, 6- albatta ibne-Mubarak ney is baab mein shiddat sey kaam liya hai lekin unhoney ye bhi kaha ke agar usney aisa kya to main ye bhi nahin kehta ke wo is par haram hogi , 7- aur Ahmed kehtey hain : agar usney shaadi ki to main usey ye hukm nahin dunga ke wo apni biwi sey alehdgi ikhtiyar kar ley , 8- Is-haq bin Raahviya kehtey hain ke main ibne-Masood ki hadees ki ru sey mansuba aurat sey nikah ki ijazat deta hun, agar usney us sey shaadi kar li , to main ye nahin kehta ke uski aurat is par haram hogi . aur ghair-mansuba aurat key silsiley mein Is-haq bin Raahviya ney wusat di hai, 9- aur Abdullah bin Mubarak sey manqul hai ke un sey eik shakhs key barey mein puchha gaya ke jisney Talaq ki qism khai ho ke wo shaadi nahin kerega, phir usey samajh mein aaya ke wo shaadi kar ley . to kya uskey liye rukhsat hai ke un fuqaha ka qol ikhtiyar karey jinhoney is silsiley mein rukhsat di hai? to Abdullah bin Mubarak ney kaha : agar wo us mamley mein padney sey pehley unkey rukhsat key qol ko durust samajhta ho to uskey liye unkey qol par amal durust hai aur agar wo pehley us qol sey mutmain na raha ho, ab aazmaaish mein pad janey par unkey qol par amal karna chahey to main uskey liye aisa karna durust nahin samajhta ."
"1212","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' laundi key liye do hi Talaq hai aur uski iddat do haiz hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ki hadees Hasan gharib hai. hum isey Mazahir bin Aslam hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain, aur Mazahir bin Aslam ki uskey ilawa koi aur riwayat merey ilm mein nahin, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin umr Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai, padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. aur yehi Sufiyan Sory , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai."
"1213","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah Taala ney meri ummat key khayalat ko jo dil mein aatey hain maaf farma diya hai jab tak ke wo unhen zaban sey ada na karey , ya un par amal na karey '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke aadmi jab apney dil mein Talaq ka khayal kar ley to kuch nahin hoga, jab tak ke wo munh sey na kahey."
"1214","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' teen cheezen aisi hain ke unhen sanjeedagi sey karna bhi sanjeedagi hai aur hansi mazaq mein karna bhi sanjeedagi hai nikah, Talaq aur wapsi'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, padhi. 2- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, 3- Abdur-Rehman, Habib bin Ardak madni key betey hain aur ibne-Maahik merey nazdik Yusuf bin maahik hain."
"1215","unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney mein Khulaa liya to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen hukm diya (ya unhen hukm diya gaya (ke wo eik haiz iddat guzaarein . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Rabee ki hadees ke unhen eik haiz iddat guzarney ka hukm diya gaya sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1216","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Khula leney wali aurten munafiq hain'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees us tareeq sey gharib hai, iski sanad qawi nahin hai, 2- Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ye bhi marvi hai aap ney farmaya : '' jis aurat ney bila kisi sabab key apney shohar sey Khula liya , to wo jannat ki khushbu nahin paeygi ''."
"1217","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jis aurat ney baghair kisi baat key apney shohar sey Talaq talab ki to is par jannat ki khushbu haram hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- aur ye « an أيوب an أبي قلابة an أبي أسماء an ثوبان » key tareeq sey bhi riwayat ki jati hai, 3- baaz ney Ayub sey isi sanad sey riwayat ki hai lekin unhoney usey marfoo nahin kya hai."
"1218","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' aurat ki misal pasli ki hai padhi. agar tum usey sidha karney lagogey to tod dogey aur agar usey yun hi chhodey rakha to tedha key bawajud tum us sey lutf andoz hogey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera ki hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai aur iski sanad jaiyed hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abu-Zar , Samra , aur ummul-momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"1219","merey nikah main eik aurat thi, main us sey mohabbat karta tha, aur merey walid usey napasand kartey they. merey walid ney mujhey hukm diya ke main usey Talaq dey dun, lekin mainey un ki baat nahin maani. phir mainey uska zikr Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey kya to aap ney farmaya : '' Abdullah bin umr ! tum apni biwi ko Talaq dey do''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, hum isey sirf ibne-Abi Zi-ib hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
"1220","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aurat apni saukan ki Talaq ka mutalba na karey ke jo uskey bartan mein hai usey apney mein undel ley''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Umme-Salma sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1221","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''har Talaq waqey hoti hai siwaye pagal aur deewaney ki Talaq key ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko hum sirf Ata bin Ajlan ki riwayat sey marfoo jantey hain aur Ata bin Ajlan zaeef aur « ذاہب الحدیث » ( hadees bhool janey waley ( hain, padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke deewaney ki Talaq waqey nahin hoti siwaye uskey ke wo aisa deewana ho jiski deewangi kabhi kabhi theek ho jati ho aur wo ifaaqa ki haalat mein Talaq dey."
"1222","logon ka haal ye tha ke aadmi apni biwi ko jitni talaaqein deeni chahta dey dena ruju kar leney ki surat mein wo uski biwi bani rehti , agar-che usney soyaa us sey zayed baar usey Talaq di ho, yahan tak ke eik aadmi ney apni biwi sey kaha : Allah ki qism ! main tujhey na Talaq dunga ke to mujh sey juda ho jaey aur na tujhey kabhi panah hi dunga . usney kaha : ye kaisey ho sakta hai? usney kaha : main tujhey Talaq dunga phir jab iddat puri honey ko hogi to rujat kar lunga. us aurat ney Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) key paas aa kar unhen ye baat batai to Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) khamosh rahIn, yahan tak ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam aaye to Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ney aap ko uski khabar di. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam bhi khamosh rahey yahan tak ke Quran nazil huwa « الطلاق مرتان فإمساك بمعروف أو تسريح بإحسان » '' Talaq ( رجعی ( do hain, phir ya to maroof aur bhaley tareeqey sey rok lena hai ya bhalai sey rukhsat kar dena hai'' ( Baqra :"
"1223","Sabiaa ney apney shohar ki maut key 23 ya 25 din baad bacha jana, aur jab wo nifaas sey pak ho gaee to nikah key liye zeenat karney lagi , is par aetraz kya gaya, aur Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey uska zikr kya gaya to aap ney farmaya : '' agar wo aisa karti hai) to harj ki baat nahin ( uski iddat puri ho chuki hai ''."
"1224","Abu-Hurera , ibne-Abbas aur abu-Salma bin Abdur-Rehman (Raziallauh anhum) ney aapas mein us hamila aurat ka zikr kya jis ka shohar faut ho chuka ho aur usney shohar ki wafat key baad bacha jana ho, ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ka kehna tha ke waza-hamal aur chaar maah das din mein sey jo muddat baad mein puri hogi uskey mutabiq wo iddat guzaaregi , aur abu-Salma ka kehna tha ke jab usney bacha jan diya to uski iddat puri ho gaee, is par Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : main apney bhatijey yani abu-Salma key sath hun. phir un logon ney (eik shakhs ko) ummul-momenin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu Anha) key paas (masla malum karney key liye ( bheja , to unhoney kaha : sabeeaa Aslamiya ney apney shohar ki wafat key kuch hi dino baad bacha jana. phir usney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey (shaadi key silsiley mein) masla puchha to aap ney isey (nifaas ka khoon khatam hotey hi ( shaadi karney ki ijazat dey di . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1225","Zenab bint abi Salma ney unhen ye teeno hadisein bataain ( un mein sey eik ye hai) Zenab kehti hain : main ummul-momenin Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu Anha) key paas aai jis waqt unkey walid abu-Sufiyaan sakhr bin Harab ka intiqal huwa , to unhoney khushbu mangaai jis mein khaluq ya kisi dusri chiz ki zardi thi, phir unhoney usey eik ladki ko lagaya phir apney dono rukhsaaron par lagaya , phir kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ki zarurat nahin thi, lekin mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna hai : Allah aur aakhirat par eman rakhney wali kisi aurat key liye jayez nahin hai ke kisi maiyat par teen din sey ziyada sog karey siwaye shohar key is par wo chaar maah das din tak sog kereygi."
"1226","Phir main Zainab binte Jahash (Raziallahu Anha) key paas aai jis waqt unkey bhai ka intiqal huwa to unhoney khushbu mangaai aur is mein sey lagaya phir kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey khushbu ki zarurat nahin thi, lekin mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey suna hai : ''Allah aur aakhirat par eman rakhney wali aurat key liye jayez nahin hai ke kisi maiyat par teen raat sey ziyada sog kare siwaye apney shohar ke, wo is par chaar maah das din sog kareygi.''"
"1227","Mainey apni maa Ummul-momenin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu Anha) ko kehtey suna ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas eik aurat ney aa kar arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! meri beti ka shohar mar gaya hai, aur uski aankhen dukh rahi hain, kya hum us ko surma laga den? Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''nahin'. do ya teen martaba us aurat ney aap sey puchha aur aap ney har baar farmaya : ''nahin'' phir aap ney farmaya : ''(ab to Islam mein) iddat chaar maah das din hai, halanke jahiliyat main tum mein sey (faut shuda shohar wali bewa) aurat saal bhar ke baad oont ki mengni phainkti thi.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Zenab ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein abu Saeed Khudri ki behan Faiya binte Malik , aur Hafsa binte umr Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira ka isi par amal hai ke jis aurat ka shohar mar gaya ho wo apni iddat ke doran khushbu aur zeenat sey perhez kareygi. Sufiyan Sory , Malik bin Anas , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi yehi qol hai."
"1228","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us zihar padhi. karney waley key barey mein jo kaffare ki adaegi sey pehley mujaamiat (sambhog) kar leta hai farmaya : ''uskey ooper eik hi kaffara hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- aksar ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. Sufiyan , Shafai , Malik , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi yehi qol hai. 3- aur baaz log kehtey hain ke agar kaffara ada karney sey pehley jimaa (sambhog) kar bethey to is par do kaffara hai. ye Abdur-Rehman bin Mehdi ka qol hai."
"1229","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas eik aadmi aaya , usney apni biwi sey zihar kar rakha tha aur phir uskey sath jimaa (sambhog) kar liya , usney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! mainey apni biwi sey zihar kar rakha hai aur kaffara ada karney sey pehley mainey us sey jimaa (sambhog) kar liya to kya hukm hai? to aap ney farmaya : ''Allah tum par reham karey kis chiz ney tujh ko is par aamada kiya?'' usney kaha : mainey chaand ki roshni mein uski paazeb dekhi (tu mujh sey sabr na ho saka) aap ney farmaya : ''uskey qarib na jana jab tak ke usey kar na lena jiska Allah ney tumhen hukm diya hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib sahih hai."
"1230","Salman bin Sakhr Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ney jo bani Biyaaza key eik fard hain apni biwi ko apney ooper mukammal maah Ramzan tak apni maa ki pusht ki tarah (haram) qarar dey liya. to jab aadha Ramzan guzar gaya to eik raat wo apni biwi sey jimaa (sambhog) kar bethey, phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaye aur aap sey is ka zikr kiya, to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sey farmaya : ''tum eik ghulam azad karo'' unhoney kaha : mujhey ye muyassar nahin. aap ney farmaya : ''phir do maah key musalsal rozey rakho'' , unhoney kaha : main iski bhi istataat nahin rakhta to aap ney farmaya : ''saath miskeen ko khana khilaao'' , unhoney kaha : main iski bhi taqat nahin rakhta, to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Farwa bin Amr sey farmaya : ''usey ye khajuron ka tokraa dey do taake ye saath miskinon ko khila dey''  « arq » eik pemana hai jis mein pandarah saa ya sola saa ghalla aata hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- Salman bin Sakhr ko Salma bin Sakhr Bayaazi bhi kaha jata hai. 3- zihar key kaffaarey key silsiley mein ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai."
"1231","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney apni biwiyon sey elaa padhi. kiya aur (un sey sohbat karna apney oopper) haram kar liya. phir aap ney haram ko halal kar liya aur qism ka kaffara ada kar diya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Muslima bin Alqama ki hadees ko jisey unhoney Dawud sey riwayat ki hai : Ali bin Mus'hir waghera ney bhi Dawud sey) riwayat ki hai magar ( Dawud ney Shaa'bi sey mursalan riwayat ki hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney elaa kiya. is mein Masruq aur Aaisha key wastey ka zikr nahin hai, aur ye Muslima bin Alqama ki hadees sey ziyada sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Anas aur abu-Musa Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain. elaa ye hai ke aadmi chaar maah ya us sey ziyada dino tak apni biwi key qarib na janey ki qism kha ley. 3- jab chaar maah guzar jaeyn to is mein ulama ka ikhtilaf hai. Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke jab chaar maah guzar jaeyn to usey qazi key samney khada kiya jaeyga, ya to ruju kar ley ya Talaq dedey. 4- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein baaz ehle-ilm ka kehna hai ke jab chaar maah guzar jaeyn to eik Talaq baaen khud ba khud pad jati hai. Sufiyan Sory aur ehle-Koofa ka yehi qol hai."
"1232","Mus'ab bin Zuber ke zamanae-amaarat mein mujh sey liaan padhi. karney walon key barey mein puchha gaya ke kya unke darmiyan tafriq (farq) kar di jaey? to main nahin jaan saka ke main unhen kya jawab dun? chunanche main apni jagah sey uth kar Abdullah bin umr Raziallahu anhuma key ghar aaya aur andar aaney ki ijazat maangi , bataya gaya ke wo qailula kar rahey hain, lekin unhoney meri baat sun li , aur kaha : ibne Juber ! aa jaao tumhen koi zarurat hi ley kar aai hogi. Saeed bin Juber kehtey hain : main unkey paas gaya to kya dekhta hun ke paalaan par bichhaaey janey waley kambal par letey hain. mainey kaha : abu-Abdur-Rehman ! kya liaan karney walon key darmiyan tafriq kar di jaeygi ? kaha : Subhan Allah ! haan , sab sey pehley is barey mein falan bin falan ney poochha. wo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaya aur usney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! agar hum mein sey koi apni biwi ko burai kartey dekhey to kya kerey? agar kuchh kehta hai to badi baat kehta hai, aur agar khamosh rehta hai to wo sangeen maamla par khamosh rehta hai. ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma kehtey hain Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam khamosh rahey aur aap ney unhen koi jawab nahin diya. phir jab kuchh din guzrey to wo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas ( dobara ( aaya aur usney arz kiya : mainey aap sey jo masla puchha tha main is mein khud mubtala kar diya gaya hun. tab Allah Taala ney Sura : Noor ki ye aayaten nazil farmaeen :« والذين يرمون أزواجهم ولم يكن لهم شهداء إلا أنفسهم » ''yani jo log apni biwiyon par tohmat zina lagatey hain aur unkey paas khud apni zaat key ilawa koi gawah nahin hain'' (Sura Noor : 6). yahan tak ke ye aayaten khatam kin, phir aap ney us aadmi ko bulaya aur usey ye aayaten padh kar sunaaeyn, aur usey nasihat ki aur uski tazkeer ki aur bataya ke duniya ka azab aakhirat key azab sey aasan hai. is par usney kaha : nahin, us zaat ki qism ! jisney aap ko haq key sath bheja hai, mainey is par jhoota ilzam nahin lagaya hai. phir aap ney wo aayaten aurat key samney dohraaeen, us ko nasihat ki, aur uski tazkeer ki aur bataya ke duniya ka azab aakhirat key azab sey aasan hai. is par us aurat ney kaha : nahin, us zaat ki qism ! jisney aap ko haq key sath bheja , wo sach nahin bol raha hai. ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma kehtey hain : aap ney mard sey ibtidaa ki, usney Allah ka naam ley kar chaar martaba gawahi di ke wo sacha hai aur paanchwen martaba gawahi di ke agar wo jhoota ho to is par Allah ki lanat ho. phir dobara aap ney aurat sey yehi baaten kahalwaaein, usney Allah ka naam ley kar chaar martaba gawahi di ke uska shohar jhoota hai, aur paanchwen martaba usney gawahi di ke agar uska shohar sacha ho to is par Allah ka ghazab nazil ho. phir aap ney un dono mein tafriq (farq) kar di. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Sehal bin Saad , ibne-Abbas , ibne-Masood aur Huzefa (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai."
"1233","Eik aadmi ney apni biwi key sath liaan kiya, to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un dono key darmiyan tafriq kar di aur ladkey ko maa key sath kar diya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai."
"1234","Fariaa bint Malik bin Sanan (Raziallahu Anha) jo abu Saeed Khudri ki behan hain ney unhen khabar di ke wo Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas ayen , wo aap sey poochh rahi thin ke wo apney ghar walon key paas bani Khadra mein wapis chali jaeyn ( huwa ye tha ke) unkey shohar apney un ghulamon ko dhoondney key liye nikley they jo bhag gaey they, jab wo maqam qudoom key kinarey par un sey miley , to un ghulamon ney unhen maar dala . Fariaa kehti hain ke mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey puchha ke main apney ghar walon key paas chali jaaun ? kyonkey merey shohar ney merey liye apni milkiyat ka na to koi makaan chhoda hai aur na kuch kharch to Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' haan '', chunanche main wapis janey lagi yahan tak ke main hujra sharifa ya masjid nabawi hi mein abhi thi ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujhey aawaz di (ya aap ney hukm diya ke mujhey aawaz di jaey) phir aap ney puchha : ''tum ney kaisey kaha? mainey wohi qissa dohra diya jo mainey aap sey apney shohar key barey mein zikr kya tha, aap ney farmaya : ''tum apney ghar hi mein raho yahan tak ke tumhari iddat khatam ho jaey '', chunanche mainey usi ghar mein chaar maah das din iddat guzaari. phir jab Usman (Raziallahu anhu) khalifa huye to unhoney mujhey bulwaaya aur mujh sey us barey mein puchha to mainey unko bataya. chunanche unhoney uski perwi ki aur usi key mutabiq faisla kya. Muhammad bin Bashaar ki sanad sey bhi us jaisi usi mafhoom ki hadees aai hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey aksar ehle-ilm ka usi hadees par amal hai, ye log iddat guzarney wali aurat key liye durust nahin samajhtey hain ke apney shohar key ghar sey muntaqil ho jab tak ke wo apni iddat na guzar ley. yehi Sufiyan Sory , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai, 3- aur Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke agar aurat apney shohar key ghar mein iddat na guzaarey to us ko ikhtiyar hai jahan chahey iddat guzaarey, 4- (Imam Tirmizi ( kehtey hain : pehla qol ziyada sahih hai."
"1235","Ibn 'Umar (ra) rivayet karte hain ki: \Nabi (ﷺ) ne Habalil-Habalah ki bey' (farokht) manfarmaya.\"" [Kaha gaya:] Is mawzoo par Abdullah bin 'Abbas (ra) aur Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (ra) ki bhi rivayatein hain. [Abu 'Eisa kaha:] Ibn 'Umar (ra) ki hadith hasan sahih hai. Ilmiyya (ulama) is amal ke amil hain. Habalil-Habalah kisi janwar ki aulad ki aulad hoti hai. Ilmiyya ke mutabiq yeh bey' batil hai aur yeh Gharar ki bey' ka ek qism hai. Shu'bah ne yeh hadith Ayyub (ra) se riwayat ki hai."""""
"1236","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Gharar ki beech karne se mana farmaya."
"1237","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne ek qabde mein do beech kiya mana farmaya. Is mozoo par Abdullah bin Amr (رضي الله عنہ) se bhi riwayatein hain."
"1238","Abū ʿĪsā (raḥimahullāh) ne ham se riwāyat kī: Abū Kurayb ne ham se riwāyat kī: Abū Usāmah ne ʿUbayd Allāh ibn ʿUmar se khabar dī, Abū al-Zinād se, al-Aʿraj se, aur Abū Hurayrah (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se, unhone farmāyā: Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne *al-gharar* (ghair muqarrar aur ghair maʿlūm cheez kī baiʿ) aur *al-ḥaṣāh* (patthar phenk kar baiʿ) se manʿ farmāyā. Unhonne (Abū ʿĪsā) kahā: Is bāb mein Ibn ʿUmar, Ibn ʿAbbās, Abū Saʿīd aur Anas (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhum ajmaʿīn) se bhi riwāyāt hain. Abū ʿĪsā ne kahā: Abū Hurayrah kī hadīs *ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ* (achchī aur sahīh) hadīs hai. ʿUlamā kā amal is hadīs par hai; unhone *al-gharar* kī baiʿ ko makrūh qarār diyā. Al-Shāfiʿī (raḥimahullāh) ne farmāyā: *Al-gharar* kī baiʿāt mein pānī mein machhlī kī baiʿ, bhāgē huē ghulām kī baiʿ, āsmān mein parindē kī baiʿ aur is jaisī dīgar muʿāmalāt shamūl hain. *Al-ḥaṣāh* kī baiʿ kā matlab yeh hai ki bāē kēhtā hai kharīdār se: \Jab maiṅ patthar phenkūṅ tō hamārī baiʿ muqarrar hō jātī hōgī.\"" Yeh *al-munābadhah* (Jāhiliyyat kī ʿahd kī baiʿ jis mein māl phenk kar baiʿ hotī thī) jaisī hai"","" aur yeh *al-Jāhiliyyah* (Jāhiliyyat kī ʿahd) kē logōṅ kī baiʿāt mein sē thī."""""
"1239","Hakim bin Hizam (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne mujhse us cheez ki beechne se mana farmaya jo mere paas na ho.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] Ye hadith hai Hasan. Unhon ne farmaya: Is mazmoon par Abdullah bin Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ki bhi riwayat hai. Ishaq bin Mansur (رحمه ullah) ne farmaya: \""Main ne Ahmad (رحمه ullah) se kaha: 'Qarz ke saath beechne se manae ki kya hai?' Unhon ne farmaya: 'Yeh ke us qarz de aur phir us se zyada qeemat par beech de"","" jabke asli qeemat kam ho.'\"""""""
"1240","Qutaybah ne hamse riwayat ki, Hushaym ne hamse riwayat ki, Abu Bishr se, Yusuf ibn Mahak se, aur Hakim ibn Hizam (raziyallahu anhu) se, unhone farmaya:\n\n\Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: 'Mere paas aik aadmi aata hai aur mujhse koi cheez farokhte hue ke liye kehta hai"","" jabke mere paas woh cheez mojud nahi hoti. Kya main uske liye bazaar se khareed kar usse bech doon?' Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us cheez ko mat bechna jo tumhare paas mojud na ho.'\""\n\nRawi ne kaha: \""Is bab mein Abdullah ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ki bhi riwayat hai.\"""""""
"1241","Hakim bin Hizam (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne mujhse mana farmaya ke main us cheez ko bechon jo mere paas mojood na ho. [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne farmaya:] Waki' ne yeh hadees Yazid bin Ibrahim (رحمهما الله) se riwayat ki hai."
"1242","Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Wala' ki bechne aur usse ata karne se mana farmaya hai. [Abu Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Humein ye sirf Abdullah bin Dinar (رحمه"
"1243","Samurah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne maal ke badle mein maal ko aaj de kar lena mana farmaya hai. Unhon ne kaha ke is mozu par Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se bhi rivayat hai."
"1244","Jabir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \janwrwn ka (dw ayk kay bdlay) adhar pr jayz nhyn۔\"""""""
"1245","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hai: \Ek ghulaam Nabi (ﷺ) ke paas Hijrat ki bay'at dene aaya.\"""""""
"1246","Hazrat Ubadah bin As-Samit (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Zar ka muamla zar ke barabar mein ho...\"""""""
"1247","Nafi' ne riwayat ki ke: \Main aur Ibn 'Umar Abu Sa'eed (رضي الله عنه) ke paas gaye aur unhone humein riwayat sunayi ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya – aur main ne apni yeh [dono] kaanon se suna – ke: 'Zar-e-zarr (sona) ko zar-e-zarr ke badle mein bechna nahi chahiye magar barabar barabar ho.'\"""""""
"1248","Suwayd ibn Nasr ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Khalid al-Hadha' se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Ash'ath se, Ubadah ibn al-Samit (رضي الله عنہ) se, aur Nabi Kareem ﷺ se marwi hai, ﷺ ne farmaya:\n\n\Sonay ka sonay ke barabar"""","""" chandi ka chandi ke barabar"""","""" khajoor ka khajoor ke barabar"""","""" gehun ka gehun ke barabar"""","""" namak ka namak ke barabar"""","""" aur jau ka jau ke barabar tabadla kiya jaye. Jo zyada de ya zyada maange"""","""" usne riba (sood) kar liya. Sonay ko chandi ke saath jaisa tum chaho"""","""" yani badle badle (naqd) becho; gehun ko khajoor ke saath jaisa tum chaho"""","""" badle badle becho; aur jau ko khajoor ke saath jaisa tum chaho"""","""" badle badle becho.\""""\n\nAbu Isa (رحمت اللہ علیہ) ne kaha: \""""Is bab mein Abu Sa'id"""","""" Abu Hurayrah"""","""" Bilal aur Anas (رضي الله عنہم) se bhi riwayatein hain.\""""\n\nAbu Isa (رحمت اللہ علیہ) ne kaha: \""""Ubadah (رضي الله عنہ) ki hasan sahih hadith hai.\""""\n\nUnhone kaha: \""""Baaz ne is hadith ko Khalid se is silsile se riwayat kaha aur kaha: 'Gehun ko jau ke saath jaisa tum chaho"""","""" badle badle becho.'\""""\n\nUnhone kaha: \""""Baaz ne is hadith ko Khalid se"""","""" Abu Qilabah se"""","""" Abu al-Ash'ath se"""","""" Ubadah (رضي الله عنہ) se"""","""" Nabi Kareem ﷺ se riwayat ki aur is mein izafa kiya ke Khalid ne kaha: Abu Qilabah ne kaha: 'Gehun ko jau ke saath jaisa tum chaho becho"""",""""' aur unhone hadith zikr ki.\""""\n\nUnhone kaha: \""""Is par amal ahl-e-ilm ka hai. Woh gehun ko gehun ke barabar ke siwa bechnay ko jaiz nahi samajhte"""","""" aur jau ko jau ke barabar ke siwa bechnay ko nahi. Lekin jab aqsam mukhtalif hon"""","""" to farq ke saath bechna koi haram nahi"""","""" shart yeh hai ke badle badle (naqd) ho. Yeh aksar ahl-e-ilm ka"""","""" Nabi Kareem ﷺ ke Sahabah (رضي الله عنہم) aur dusron ka masla hai"""","""" aur yeh Sufyan al-Thawri"""","""" al-Shafi'i"""","""" Ahmad aur Ishaq (رحمت اللہ علیہم) ka masla bhi hai.\""""\n\nAl-Shafi'i (رحمت اللہ علیہ) ne kaha: \""""Is ka saboot Nabi Kareem ﷺ ka yeh irshad hai: 'Jau ko gehun ke saath jaisa tum chaho"""","""" badle badle becho.'\""""\n\nAbu Isa (رحمت اللہ علیہ) ne kaha: \""""Ahl-e-ilm mein se ek giroh ne gehun ko jau ke saath barabar ke siwa bechna makruh samjha"""","""" aur yeh Malik ibn Anas (رحمت اللہ"""""""""
"1249","Ibn Shihab ne riwayat kiya: Malik bin Aws bin Hadathan se, unhone kaha: \Maine ek baar kaha: 'Kuch badal sakta hai kuch dirham ko?' to Talhah bin 'Ubaidullah - jo 'Umar bin Al-Khattab (radiyallahu 'anhu) ke saath ho rahe the - ne kaha: \""Apna dhana hamare paas rakh do...\"""""""
"1250","Salim (rz all anh) nay apnay wald (abdallh bn amr rz all anhma) say rwayt ky kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs ksy khjwr kay drkht kw as wqt khryday jb as pr qlm (tlqyh) hw chky hw، tw as ka phl bychnay walay kay lyay hwga۔\"""""""
"1251","Riba (Sood) ke Currency aur Commodity Exchange par Hadith\n\nMalik ibn Aws ibn al-Hadathan — radhiAllahu 'anhu — ki riwayat:\n\nUnhon ne farmaya: \Main yeh keh raha tha ke 'Kaam dirhamein badalne wala kaun hai?' Is par Talhah ibn 'Ubaydullah — radhiAllahu 'anhu — jo 'Umar ibn al-Khattab — radhiAllahu 'anhu — ki mehfil mein maujood the — ne kaha: 'Apna sunaah humein dikhao"","" phir jab humara naukar aa jaye to hum tumhein chandi de denge.'\""\n\nIs par 'Umar ibn al-Khattab — radhiAllahu 'anhu — ne farmaya: \""Nahi! Wallah"","" tum ya to uski chandi uske sunaah ke badle de do"","" ya uska sunaah usi ko wapas kar do. Kyunki Rasoolullah — sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam — ne farmaya:\n\n> *'Chandi ke badle sunaah sood (riba) hai"","" siwaye yad-ba-yad [yaani fori taur par] ke. Gehun ke badle gehun sood hai"","" siwaye yad-ba-yad ke. Jau ke badle jau sood hai"","" siwaye yad-ba-yad ke. Khajoor ke badle khajoor sood hai"","" siwaye yad-ba-yad ke.'*\""\n\nAbu 'Isa [al-Tirmidhi] ne kaha: Yeh hasan sahih hadith hai. Ahl-e-ilm ki is par amal hai. Unke — sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam — irshad *\""siwaye yad-ba-yad ke\""* ka matlab hai: fori aur muqasamah muqasamah tabadla (*yadan bi-yadin*).\n\n\n\nUloomi Wazahat:\n\nYeh hadith Islami mu'amalat (maali muamalat) ki fiqh mein buniyadi daleel hai"","" jis mein riba al-fadl (zaaida se sood) ke haraam hone ka hukm mukhtalif ajnass (jins) ke muttazad ashiya ke tabadle mein sabit hai"","" aur fori aur muqasamah muqasamah tabadla (*taqabud*) ko is tabadle ki jaiz hone ke liye zaroori shart tayin ki gai hai. Chaar madhaahib ke ulama ne currency exchange (*sarf*) aur ghizaai ashiya ke beech ke hukumat mein is hadith par wasi'ah i'tibar kiya hai."""""
"1252","Hakim bin Hizam (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kharidar aur bechnay walay donon ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak ke unhain juda na hon. Aur agar unhain sach bolain aur (kisi nuqsan ya shart ko) wazeh kar dein...\"""""""
"1253","Wāṣil ibn ʿAbd al-Aʿlā al-Kūfī ne hamein sunā, kā: Ibn Fuḍayl ne hamein sunā, Yaḥyā ibn Saʿīd se, Nāfiʿ se, Ibn ʿUmar (Ḥaz̤rat ʿUmar aur Ḥaz̤rat ʿAbdullāh ke farishte, Ḥaqq Tāʿālā un dono se razī ho) se, unhon ne kiyā:\n\n> \Maine Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ko farmāte sunā: \""""Bēch kharīd ke dono qabāze ke darmiyān radd kī ikhtiyār (option) jab tak hai jab tak ke wām nā ho jāṅ"""","""" yā (jab tak) un se ek (isay mustaḥkarn) nā kar le.\""""\n\nUnhon ne kiyā: Jab bhi Ibn ʿUmar (Ḥaqq Tāʿālā us se razī ho) baiṭh kar kharīd-farōshī karte"""","""" wahīṅ ke wahīṅ uṭh khade hō jāte tāke us par wām mustaḥkar (binding) ho jāṅ.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (al-Tirmidhī) ne kiyā: Aur is bāb mein Abū Barzah"""","""" Ḥakīm ibn Ḥizām"""","""" Ḥaz̤rat ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿAbbās"""","""" Ḥaz̤rat ʿAbdullāh ibn ʿAmr"""","""" Samurah"""","""" aur Abū Hurayrah (Ḥaqq Tāʿālā un sab se razī ho) ke ḥāwāle se riwāyātāṅ haiṅ.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā ne kiyā: Ibn ʿUmar kī hadith ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ (mustaḥkarn aur ṣaḥīḥ) hai. Is par ʿamal ahl-e-ʿilm meṅ se baʿz̤ Ṣaḥāba-e-Kirām (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) aur ghair Ṣaḥāba ne qarār diyā hai. Yahi Imām Shāfiʿī"""","""" Imām Aḥmad"""","""" aur Isḥāq ibn Rāhwayh kā qawl hai"""","""" unhone kiyā: \""""Judāī (separation) ādmī ke badan se hai"""","""" bātān (speech) se nā.\""""\n\nAhl-e-ʿilm meṅ se baʿz̤ ne kiyā ke Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ke farmān \""""jab tak wām nā ho jāṅ\"""" kā matlab bātānī judāī (yaʿnī zabānī iʿlān) hai. Lākin pahlā qawl aqwā (zyāda ṣaḥīḥ) hai"""","""" kyunke Ibn ʿUmar (Ḥaqq Tāʿālā us se razī ho) hī haiṅ jinhōṅ ne yah hadith Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) se sunā aur woh apnī sunī huʄī bāt kā matlab se zyāda waqif haiṅ. Un se marwī hai ke jab woh kharīd-farōshī mustaḥkar karnā chāhte"""","""" to chal kar mustaḥkar kar lete tāke us par wām mustaḥkar ho jāṅ. Aur isī tarah Abū Barzah al-Aslamī (Ḥaqq Tāʿālā us se razī ho) se bhi marwī hai."""""""""
"1254","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yeh dono (khareed aur farokht) is qadar juda nahi hotiyan illah is par jabke dono taraf se ittefaaq ho.\"" Abu Eisa (رحمه"""""
"1255","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne ek Badawi ko khareed o farokht ke baad ikhtiyaar (khayyarat) diya.\"" Ye hadith Hasan Gharib hai."""""
"1256","Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنهم) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi tha jo zyada samajhdaar nahi tha aur woh kharidariyan karta rehta tha. Uske ahl-e-bait Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas aaye aur arz kiya: \Ya Rasoolullah! Aap usay (kharidari se) rok lijiye.\"" Pas"","" Allah ke Nabi (ﷺ) ne usay bulaya aur usay mana farma diya."""""
"1257","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs aysay janwr khryday js ka dhychka nh gzarh hw\"""""""
"1258","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne aisa jaanwar khareed jiska dohna na kiya gaya ho\"""""""
"1259","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay ayk awnt nby akrm ﷺ kw bycha awr as myn yh shrt aayd ky kh wh as pr swar hw kr apnay ghr waps aa sktay hyn\n\nabwaysyٰ nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ yh jabr (rz all anh) say dwsry trq say bhy mrwy hay۔ nby ﷺ kay shabh kram awr dwsray ahl alm myn say baz kay nzdyk as pr aml hay۔ an ka khyal hay kh bya myn ayk shrt aayd krna jayz hay۔ yh ahmd awr ashaq bn rahwyh (rhmhma all) ka qwl bhy hay۔ awr baz ahl alm ka khyal hay kh bya myn kwyy shrt aayd krna jayz nhyn۔"
"1260","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ek sawari (janwar) girwi rakhe hue bhi ki ja sakti hai.\"""""""
"1261","Fazalah bin Ubaidah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke:\n\nKhaibar ke din maine ek haar khareed jis mein aurat ke liye sona aur jawahar tha, barah dinar mein. Usse alag karke dekha to uska qeemat barah dinar se zyada thi. Main ne Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se iska zikr kiya, to Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tak alag na kar lo"","" bechna nahi chahiye.\""\n\nJam'e Tirmazi"","" Hadees: 1255"""""
"1262","Al-Aswad (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: Hazrat Aisha Siddiqah (رضي الله عنها) ne Barirah (رضي الله عنها) ko khareedna chaha tha."
"1263","Fadālah ibn ʿUbayd (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) ne bayān farmāyā: \n\Main ne Khaybar ke din ek hār khareedā jis kī qeemat bārah dīnār thī. Us mein sonā aur motī dono the. Jab maine us kī alag alag qeemat māpī to us kī qeemat bārah dīnār se zyādā niklī. Main ne yih bāt Nabī ﷺ se bayān kī. Aap ne farmāyā: 'Yih hār tab tak nahīñ bechnā jā sakegā jab tak us ke ajzā (sonā aur motī) kī alag alag qeemat na māpī jāe.'\"""""""
"1264","Qutaybah ne hamse riwayat ki: Ibn al-Mubarak ne hamse riwayat ki, Abu Shuja' Sa'id ibn Yazid se, isi isnad ke saath, is jaisi koi riwayat. Abu Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: Ye hasan sahih hadith hai. Is par amal kuch ahl-e-ilm mein se Nabi Kareem, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, ke sahaba aur ghair sahaba ke nazdiq hain. Unhon ne sonay se zeenat-shuda talwar ya chandi se araish-shuda pattari, ya is jaisi cheezon ki dirham ke badle mein bechna jaiz nahi mana, jab tak ke woh alag aur makhlooq na ho jaye. Ye Ibn al-Mubarak, al-Shafi'i, Ahmad, aur Ishaq ka qaul hai. Aur kuch ahl-e-ilm mein se Nabi Kareem, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, ke sahaba aur ghair sahaba ne is mein rukhsaat di hai."
"1265","Aur main ne un mein se ek ko ek Dinar mein becha. Phir main ne oont aur Dinar ke saath Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas wapas aaya, aur main ne jo hua woh bataaya. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Allah tumhare karobar mein barkat aayez kare.\"" Is ke baad hum Kunasah mein Al-Kufah gaye aur us ne bahut zyada nafa kiya aur woh Al-Kufah ke sab se ameer logon mein se tha.\n"
"1266","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab mukatab (ghulaam jo apni azaadi ke liye muawzaqa kar chuka ho) ki diyat (khoon ka badla) uski taraf jaaye"","" to uska haqdaar wohi hai jo uski azaadi ke liye muawzaqa karne wala hai.\"""""""
"1267","Riwayat:\n\nHazrat Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Darimi ne humein riwayat ki, unhone kaha ke Habban — jo Abu Habib al-Basri the — ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha ke Harun al-Awar al-Muqri' — jo ek qaari (tilawat karne wale) the — ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha ke al-Zubayr ibn al-Khirrit ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha ke Abu Labid ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha ke Hazrat 'Urwah al-Bariqi (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne farmaya:\n\nRasool Allah (ﷺ) ne mujhe ek dinar diya ke main unke liye ek bakra khareed loon. Main ne unke liye do bakre khareed liye, phir un mein se ek bakre ko ek dinar mein bech diya aur doosra bakra aur woh dinar Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas le aaya. Main ne unhe poori baat batai, to Aap (ﷺ) ne us par barkat ki dua farmai aur farmaya:\n\n\Bārak Allāhu laka fī ṣafqat yaminik\"""" *(Allah Ta'ala tere dahine haath ke saude mein barkat ata farmaye).*\n\nIs ke baad woh Kūfah ke bazaar jaate aur bahut zyada nafa kamate"""","""" aur aakhir mein Kūfah ke ameer-tar logon mein se ban gaye.\n\n\n\n*Wa Allahu A'lam (Aur Allah Ta'ala sab se behtar jaante hain).*"""""""""
"1268","Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنها) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi aurat ke paas aisa Mukatab ho jiske paas woh maal ho jo uski Kitabah (ghulami se azaadi ka muqarrara qeemat) ada karne ke liye kafi ho"","" to us se Hijab ikhtiyar karein.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Aur ahl-e-ilm ke nazdeek is Hadith ka matlab hifazat aur ehtiyat hai. Woh kehte hain ke Mukatab (ghulam) azaad nahi hota jab tak uski tamam qeemat ada na ho jaye."""""
"1269","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs as hal myn hw jayay kh wh mfls smjha jayay۔\"""""""
"1270","Abu Al-Waddak ne riwayat ki ke Abu Sa'eed ne farmaya: \Hamare paas ek yateem ki sharab thi. Jab surah Al-Ma'idah nazil hui"","" to maine RasoolAllah (ﷺ) se iske bare mein poocha.\"""""""
"1271","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \amant ada krw as shkhs kw jw tm pysh ky hw۔\"""""""
"1272","Abu Umamah (rzy allh anh) khth ky rwayt ky kh wh hjth alwdaa kay sal myn waqa shdh waqaay ka zkr kr rhay thay۔"
"1273","Abu Sa'eed Khudri (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\nUnhon ne kaha: \Hamare paas ek yateem ki sharab (mai) thi. Jab Surah al-Ma'idah nazil hui"""","""" to maine Rasoolullah ﷺ se iske bare mein poocha aur kaha"""","""" 'Yeh ek yateem ki hai.' Aap ﷺ ne farmaya: 'Use baha do (phenk do).'\""""\n\nRawi ne kaha: \""""Is bab mein Anas ibn Malik (raziyallahu 'anhu) ki bhi riwayat hai.\""""\n\nAbu 'Eesaa (Tirmizi) ne kaha: \""""Abu Sa'eed ki hasan hadith hai. Is jaisi riwayatein Nabi ﷺ se aur silsilon se bhi aayi hain. Kuch ulama ne yeh raay di aur sharab ko sirka (vinegar) banana makruh samjha. Aur is mein jo makruh mana gaya — aur Allah zyada jaanta hai — yeh hai ke kisi Musalman ke ghar mein sharab ho jab tak woh sirka ban jaye. Lekin baaz ulama ne sharab ka sirka"""","""" agar woh pehle se sirka ban chuka ho"""","""" jaiz kiya hai.\""""\n\nTawzeeh: Abu al-Waddaak ka naam Jabr ibn Nawf hai."""""""""
"1274","Abū Kurayb ne hamāre ḥāṯir ḥadīth bīyān kī, Ṭalq ibn Ghannām ne hamāre ḥāṯir ḥadīth bīyān kī, Sharīq aur Qays se, Abū Ḥuṣayn se, Abū Ṣāliḥ se, Abū Hurayrah se, unhone farmāyā: Nabī, ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam ne farmāyā: \Amanat us ḏī jis ne tujhe amānat dī"","" aur khāʾin ke sāth khiyānat na kar.\"" Abū ʿĪsā ne farmāyā: Ye ḥasan gharīb ḥadīth hai. Baʿḍ ulamā ne is ḥadīth ke taṣadduq kīā aur farmāyā: Agar kisī ādmī ke pās dūsre kī kuch cīz ho aur use le le"","" phir us kī kuch cīz us dūsre ke pās ā jāʾe"","" to us haqq meṯāl ke mustaḥiq nahīṯ hai ke us se use muāwazā na le. Baʿḍ ulamā min al-tābiʿīn ne is masle meṯā rukhṣat dī hāṯī hai. Ye raʾy al-Thawrī hai"","" unhone farmāyā: Agar us par darāhim aur dīnār hote hain aur dīnār us ke pās ā jāʾe"","" to us ke haqq meṯāl ke mustaḥiq nahīṯ hai ke darāhim ke muāwazā dīnār rok le"","" jab tak darāhim us ke pās us kī ṯaraf se na ā jāʾe; us waqt woh darāhim meṯāl se muāwazā le saktā hai."""""
"1275","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Bazaar (qaaflay) se milne ke liye mat niklo.\"""""""
"1276","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne kisi Musalmaan ke maal ko chheenne ke liye jhooti qasam kha li\"""""""
"1277","Ibn Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab do fareeq (muaameley mein) ikhtilaaf karein to baayeh (farokhtan wale) ki baat maqbool ki jati hai.\"""""""
"1278","Abu Al-Minhal se riwayat hai ke Iyas bin Abd al-Muzani ne farmaya: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne pani ki neekar se mana farmaya.\"" [Unhon ne kaha:] Is mauzoo par Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ki bhi riwayatein hain."""""
"1279","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby akrm (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \zayd pany rwkw nhyn kh as say chragah kw rwka jayay۔\"" [abw aysyٰ nay kha:] yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ abw almnhl ka nam abdalrhmn bn mtam hay۔"""""
"1280","Ibn 'Umar (raziyallahu 'anhu) rivayti karte hain ke Nabi (ﷺ) ne aseeri faras (stud) ka istemaal man' farmaya. [Ravi kehte hain:] Is mazkur par Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu 'anhu) se bhi rivayaat maujood hain."
"1281","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh ayk shkhs qbylh klab say hzrt rswl allh (ﷺ) kw ntfh andwzy kay baray myn swal kya tw aap (ﷺ) nay asay mna frmaya۔ as nay arz kya: ya rswl allh (ﷺ)! hm ntfh andwzy as lyay krtay hyn kh hmyn ajrt mlty hay (madyanh kay malkwn say)۔ tw aap (ﷺ) nay ajrt kay lyay as ky ajazt dy\n\nabw aysyٰ (rhm allh alyh) nay frmaya: yh hdys hsn ghryb hay۔"
"1282","Rafi bin Khadij (رضي الله عنho) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Hajjam ki kamai (khoon chhunkar nikaalne ki kamai) gandagi hai.\"""""""
"1283","Abu Mas'ud Al-Ansari (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne kimat-e-kutte (ki qeemat) se mana farmaya."
"1284","Anas ibn Mālik (raziyallāhu ʿanhu) se marwi hai:\n\nEk ādmī qabīle Kilāb se Nabī ﷺ ke pās āyā aur us ne ʿasb-e-faḥl (nar jānwar kī bachchā dene kī ujrat) ke bāre mein pūchhā. Nabī ﷺ ne ise manaʿ farmāyā. Ādmī ne kahā, \Yā Rasūlallāh! Hum apne nar jānwar ko (māda jānwaron ko) milne dete hain aur hamen (is kī badaulat) izzat-o-karāmat milnī chāhiye.\"""" Nabī ﷺ ne phir us ko karāmat (yaʿnī"""","""" izzat-o-sharf ke taur par ek tohfa yā shukrguzārī kī chīz qabool karne kī) ke bāre mein rukhaṣat (ijāzat) dī.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: Ye ḥasan gharīb hadith hai. Ham ise sirf Ibrāhīm ibn Ḥumaid ke riwāyat se Hishām ibn ʿUrwah ke zariye jānte hain.\n\n\n\nAham Iṣṭilāḥāt ke Bāre mein Tafṣīl:\n\n- ʿAsb al-faḥl (عَسْبُ الفَحْلِ): Nar jānwar kī bachchā dene kī ujrat. Nabī ﷺ ne ise pahle manaʿ farmāyā kyunke ye jānwar kī tawlīdī ṣalāḥiyyat par muʿāmlā kī shakl thā"""","""" jise bechnā jāiz nahīñ hai.\n- Nuṭriq al-faḥl (نُطْرِقُ الفَحْلَ): \""""Ham nar jānwar ko milne dete hain\"""" — yānī apne nar jānwar ko nasl-pasandī ke liye dene kī ʿādat.\n- Nukramu (نُكْرَمُ): \""""Hamen izzat/tohfa milnī chāhiye\"""" — ādmī ne bayān kiyā ke log unhe ek tohfa yā shukrguzārī kī nishānī dete hain"""","""" jo ek muqarrar ujrat nahīñ hotī.\n- Rukhaṣa fī al-karāma (رُخْصَةٌ فِي"""""""""
"1285","Hazrat Anas (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \hzwr nby krym ﷺ kw pchha lgaya gya۔ hzrt abw tlhh (rz all anh) nay pchha lgaya۔ aap ﷺ nay hkm dya kh anhyn dw saa khana dya jayay۔\"""""""
"1286","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) rivayat karte hain ke \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne aurat aur billi ke qeemat (ki se) mana' farmaya.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Is hadith ke silsile mein idtirab (kuch ghabrahat) hai. Billi ke qeemat (is silsile mein) sahih nahin hai. Ye hadith Al-A'mash (رحمه"""""
"1287","Jabir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \rswl allh (ﷺ) nay bly ka gwsht khanay awr as ky qymt (yany bly ky khryd w frwkht) say mna frmaya۔\"" [abw aysyٰ nay kha:] yh hdys ghryb hay۔ hm amr bn zyd (ayk rawy) say swayay abdalrzaq kay ksy bray (marwf) rawy kw nhyn jantay jnhwn nay rwayt ky hw۔"""""
"1288","Abu Al-Muhazzim ne riwayat ki, Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se, unhone farmaya: \Kutte ke qeemat (price) se mana kiya gaya.\"""""""
"1289","Abu Umamah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Gaaney waaliyon (yaani gaaney waali laundiyon ko) mat becho.\"""""""
"1290","Abu Ayyub (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmaate suna ke: \Jis shakhs ne kisi maa ko uski aulaad se juda kiya...\"""""""
"1291","Hazrat Ali (Razi Allah un par ho) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) ne mujhe do ladke diye jo bhai-bhai the.\"""""""""""""
"1292","Aisha (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne faisla farmaya ke: \Fasal ka haasil zimmedar ke liye hai.\"" [Abu Isa (رحمه الله) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Ye Hadith iske siwa aur tariqon se bhi marwi hai."""""
"1293","Aisha (رضي الله عنها) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne faisla farmaya ke phal (paidawar) zimmedar ke liye hai. [Qawl:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai."
"1294","Ibn Umar (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh nby krym ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs ksy bagh myn dakhl hw tw asay khanay ky ajazt hay۔\"""""""
"1295","Rafi' bin 'Amr (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke main kuch Ansar ki khajoor ke darakht par kankrian phenk raha tha. Woh mujhe le kar Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke paas gaye. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ya Rafi'! Tum unki khajoor ke darakht par kankrian kyun phenk rahe the?\"" Maine khaas: \""Bhookh ki wajah se.\"""""""
"1296","Abū Salamah ne hamse riwāyat kī, Yaḥyā ibn Khalaf ne, ʿUmar ibn ʿAlī al-Muqaddamī ne, Hishām ibn ʿUrwah se, uske wālid se, ʿĀʾishah (Allah us se raazī ho) se riwāyat ki ke Nabī Kareem (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā: al-kharāj (nafʿa yā munāfaʿa) al-ḍamān (zimmedārī) ke sāth hai.\n\nUnhon ne farmāyā: Yeh ḥasan ṣaḥīh gharīb ḥadīth hai, Hishām ibn ʿUrwah kī riwāyat se.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: Muḥammad ibn Ismāʿīl (Bukhārī) ne is ḥadīth ko ʿUmar ibn ʿAlī kī riwāyat se gharīb qarār diyā.\n\nMaine pūchhā: Kāpne is mein tadlīs (isnād mein chhupāw) dekhte hain? Unhon ne farmāyā: Nahīn.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā ne farmāyā: Muslim ibn Khālid al-Zanjī ne bhī yeh ḥadīth Hishām ibn ʿUrwah se riwāyat kī, aur Jarīr ne bhī Hishām se riwāyat kī.\n\nJarīr kī ḥadīth mein tadlīs kā qaul hai; Jarīr ne is mein tadlīs kī, kyunke unhone ise Hishām ibn ʿUrwah se sīdhe nahīn sunā thā.\n\n\Al-kharāj bi al-ḍamān\"" (nafʿa zimmedārī ke sāth hai) kī tafsīr yeh hai: Ek ādmī ek ghulām ḵharīd le"","" us se nafʿa uṭhāe"","" phir ek ʿaib pakar le aur use bāp (farokhtanewāle) ko wāpas kar de. Is ḥālat mein ghallah (nafā) ḵharīdnewāle kā hai"","" kyunke agar ghulām halāk hotā"","" toh nuqsān us kī māl kī zimmedārī par ātā.\n\nFiqh mein isī qāʿide par māmūlāt chaltī hain: jahān ḍamān (zimmedārī) ho"","" wahān kharāj (nafʿa) us ke sāth hotā hai.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā ne farmāyā: Muḥammad ibn Ismāʿīl ne is ḥadīth ko ʿUmar ibn ʿAlī kī riwāyat se gharīb qarār diyā. Maine pūchhā: Kāpne is mein tadlīs dekhte hain? Unhon ne farmāyā: Nahīn."""""
"1297","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Al-Muhaqalah se mana farmaya.\"""""""
"1298","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs koi khareeday...\"""""""
"1299","Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Tum mein se kisi ko doosre ki beech mein uski bech ki bech karne ki ijazat nahi.\"""""""
"1300","Abu Talhah (raziyaAllahu anho) ne arz kiya: \Ya NabiAllah! Maine apni parwarish mein mukhtalif yatamon ke liye kuch sharab khareed li thi.\"""" Aap (sallAllahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \""""Sharab ko phenk do.\"""""""""""""
"1301","Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh myn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) say pwchha: \kya shrab say srkh bnaya ja skta hay؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""nhyn۔\"" abw aysyٰ (altrmzy) nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔"""""
"1302","\Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne sharab ke muta'addid logon par la'nat bhejne wale ahad mein se das logon par la'nat farmai: jisne usay nichoda"""""""""
"1303","Samurah bin Jundab (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \tm myn say kwyy shkhs jb mwyshywn kay pas phnchay\"""""""
"1304","Jabir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنهما) ne bayan kiya ke Fateh Makke (فتح مکہ) ke dauraan..."
"1305","Ibn 'Abbas (rzy allh anhma) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \hmara bd nmwnh nhyn hay: jw shkhs apna thfh waps lay lay، wh ktay ky mannd hay jw apny qay kw waps lay lay۔\"" anhwn nay kha: as mwzwa pr۔"""""
"1306","Amr bin Shu'aib ne riwayat ki ke unhone Tawus se suna, aur Tawus ne Ibn Umar (radi Allahu anho) aur Ibn Abbas (radi Allahu anho) se riwayat ki."
"1307","Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne Zaid bin Thabit (رضي الله عنه) se naqil farmaya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne Al-Muhalaqah aur Al-Muzabanah se mana farmaya."
"1308","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay panch wsq say km mqdar myn arya ky ajazt dy ya as kay mshabh kw\njama trmzy hdys: arby hdys:"
"1309","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki hai ke Zaid bin Thabit (رضي الله عنہ) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Al-'Araya ki qimat ka andaza lagakar uski beejh ki ijazat di. [Abu Eisa (رحمت اللہ علیہ) ne kaha:] Yeh Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنہ) ki bhi Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Aur ahl-e-ilm mein se baaz is par amal karte hain, jin mein se ek Imam Shafi'i (رحمت اللہ علیہ) bhi hain."
"1310","Hannād ne hamari taraf se riwāyat kī, ʿAbdah ne riwāyat kī, Muḥammad ibn Isḥāq se, Nāfiʿ se, Ibn ʿUmar se, Zayd ibn Thābit radiya'llāhu ʿanhu se, ke Nabī ﷺ ne *al-muḥāqalah* aur *al-muzābanah* se manʿ farmāyā, magar unhone *al-ʿarāyā* wāloñ ko unheñ unke andāze ke mutābiq bechne kī ijāzat dī.\n\nFarmāyā: \Is bāb meñ Abū Hurayrah aur Jābir radiya'llāhu ʿanhumā se bhī riwāyāt haiñ.\""""\n\nAbū ʿĪsā ne farmāyā: \""""Zayd ibn Thābit kī ḥadīth — isī tarah Muḥammad ibn Isḥāq ne yeh ḥadīth bayān kī. Aur Ayyūb"""","""" ʿUbaydullāh ibn ʿUmar"""","""" aur Mālik ibn Anas ne Nāfiʿ se"""","""" Ibn ʿUmar se riwāyat kī hai ke Nabī ﷺ ne *al-muḥāqalah* aur *al-muzābanah* se manʿ farmāyā. Aur isī sanad ke sāth"""","""" Ibn ʿUmar se"""","""" Zayd ibn Thābit se"""","""" Nabī ﷺ se"""","""" ke unhone *al-ʿarāyā* meñ rukhṣat dī. Aur yeh ḥadīth Muḥammad ibn Isḥāq kī ḥadīth se *aṣaḥḥ* (zyāda saḥīḥ) hai.\""""\n\n\n\nTawḍīḥ: *Al-muḥāqalah* se murād woh bayʿ hai jis meñ khet meñ lagī ghāh (ānā) ko kaṭī ghāh ke badle meñ bechā jā'e"""","""" aur *al-muzābanah* se murād woh bayʿ hai jis meñ darakht par tāzā khajūr khushk khajūr ke paimāne se bechī jā'e — yeh dono aqsām *gharar* (ghair muqarrarī) wālī bayʿ haiñ. *Al-ʿarāyā* se murād woh rukhṣat hai jis meñ darakht par khajūr ko andāze se tāzā khajūr khāne ke liye bechnā jā'iz hai."""""""""
"1311","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \njsh nh krw۔\"" [rawy nay kha:] as mwzwa pr abn amr (rz all anhma) awr ans (rz all anh) ky bhy rwayat mwjwd hyn۔ [abw aysyٰ nay kha:] abwhryrh (rz all anh) ky hdys hsn shyh hay۔ ahl alm kay nzdyk asy pr aml hay۔"""""
"1312","Suwaid bin Qais (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay kha: \myn awr mkhrfh abdy (rz all anh) nay hjr (kay alaqay) say kpray layay۔ nby krym ﷺ hmaray pas aayay awr hmaray sath tkywn (ptlwnwn) ky khrydary ka maamlh krna chaha۔ myray sath ayk shkhs tha jw (mal) twkta takh as ky qymt tay hw skay۔ tw nby krym ﷺ nay twlnay walay say frmaya: 'tw lw awr (twltay wqt) zyadh kr day'\""\n\n(rawy) nay kha: as mwzwa pr jabr (rz all anh) awr abwhryrh (rz all anh) say bhy rwayat hyn\n\nabw aysy (trmzy) nay kha: swyd ky hdys hsn shyh hay۔ ahl alm twltay wqt zyadh dynay kw msthb smjhtay hyn۔ shabh nay yh hdys smak say rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"1313","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) kay rwayt krdh hdys kay mtabq، rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs ksy fqyr kw mhlt day ya as ky mshkl kw dwr kr day۔\"""""""
"1314","Abu Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \tm say phlay ayk shkhs kw hsab kay lyay blaya gya tw as kay sath kwyy nyky nhyn payy gy۔ swayay as kay kh wh ayk maldar shkhs tha، wh lwgwn kay sath ml jl kr rhta tha awr apnay nwkr kw hkm dyta tha kh tng dst mqrwz say nrmy akhtyar kray۔ tw allh taalyٰ nay frmaya: hm as say zyadh hqdar hyn kh asay maaf kryn، asay maaf kr dw۔\"""""""
"1315","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ameer shakhs ka qarz mein taal-muluki zulm hai. Pas agar tumhara qarz tumhare qarzdaar se ek ameer qarzdaar ki taraf muntaqal kiya jaye...\"""""""
"1316","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ameer shakhṣ par qarz mein taakhīr karna zulm hai. Pas agar tumhare qarz karne wale (debtor) se tumhare haq mein qarz kisi aur par ho jaye"","" to tum ise qubool karo.\"""""""
"1317","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Munabadhah aur Mulamasah ki beech se manfarmaya farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Is mozoo par Abu Saeed aur Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهم) se bhi rivayatain hain. Abu Isa (رحمت الله علیہ) ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ki hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Aur is hadith mein Munabadhah ka matlab yeh hai ke jab kaha jaye ke \Jab main tumhare liye kuch phenk doon to tumhare aur mere darmiyan beech ho chuki hai.\"" Aur Mulamasah yeh hai ke woh kahe ke \""Jab tum kuch chhoo lo to beech ho chuki hai.\"" Bhale hi usne bilkul dekha hi na ho."""""
"1318","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke \Jab Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) Al-Madinah Munawwarah mein tashreef laaye"""""
"1319","Jabir bin ‘Abdullah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh allh kay rswl (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \js kay pas ayk bagh myn shryk hwn awr as myn as ka hsh hwn\""۔"""""
"1320","Abu az-Zubair ne riwayat ki ke Jabir (رضي الله عنه) se naqil kiya ke Nabi (ﷺ) ne Al-Muhaqalah (ہبے کے بیع) نہیں کی ممنوع فرمائی۔"
"1321","Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya ke: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke zamaane mein qeematein bahut zyada chadh gayi thin.\"""""""
